        "description": "\"Bubbles & More\" has a variety of activities to amuse and delight as you while away the time. Designed as \"hand tracking first\", you can put down those controllers to enjoy a more immersive experience.\n\nBubbles:  Relax in this chill experience where you can blow some bubbles, bat them around, or pop them with spitballs. There are a few other bells and whistles to discover.\n\nCards: Test your aim by grabbing and throwing charged up playing cards like a certain Cajun comic book hero.  \n\nMore activities coming soon.",
